@startuml state-reservation-lifecycle
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica Neue"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam ArrowThickness 1
skinparam UsecaseBackgroundColor #FFFFCE
skinparam UsecaseBorderColor #000000
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActorBorderColor #000000
skinparam ActorFontColor #000000
skinparam RectangleBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam RectangleBorderColor #000000
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #FFFFCE
skinparam StateBorderColor #000000
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFCE
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #000000
skinparam LifelineBorderColor #000000
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam noteBorderColor #777777

title State Diagram - Reservation Lifecycle (Iteration 1, behavioral view)
[*] --> Initiated
Initiated --> PendingPayment : enterPassengerInfo / processPayment
PendingPayment --> Confirmed : payment authorized
PendingPayment --> Cancelled : payment failed / hold expired
Confirmed --> Ticketed : issueTicket
Confirmed --> CancellationRequested : requestCancellation
Ticketed --> CancellationRequested : requestCancellation
CancellationRequested --> Cancelled : confirmCancellation
Cancelled --> RefundRequested : requestRefund
RefundRequested --> Refunded : processRefundDecision(approved)
RefundRequested --> Cancelled : processRefundDecision(denied)
Refunded --> [*]
note "Eight states with event-driven transitions; each transition is handled by the matching State object (see Section 6)." as N1
@enduml
